        "q2": "<div style='background-color: #f1f2f6; border-left: 5px solid #00cec9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px;'><strong style='display: block; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 5px;'>Part 2: Questions 11-20</strong><span style='font-size: 0.9rem; color: #57606f;'>Questions 11-16: Choose the correct letter, <strong>A, B or C</strong>.</span></div><div style='display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 30px;'><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>11</span> 11. What is the most important attitude towards making mistakes according to Arthur?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-11' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='11'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> Mistakes are inevitable.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> Mistakes can be a chance to learn.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> Mistakes can cause serious consequences.</span></div></div></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>12</span> 12. What's true about self-confidence according to Arthur?</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-12' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='12'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> Self-confidence sometimes leads to failure.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> It means